parameters.help_en:
The request path. Format:
/api/v1/providers/{provider}/products/{product}/resources/{resourceType}

Variables in the request path:

provider: the cloud provider. Currently, only Aliyun is supported.

product: the product code.

resourceType: the resource type. If the resource has a parent resource, the format is {parent resource type code}/parent resource ID/{resource type code}

parameters.help_zh:
请求路径。格式为：
/api/v1/providers/{provider}/products/{product}/resources/{resourceType}

请求路径中变量说明：

provider: 云厂商，目前只支持Aliyun。

product: 产品Code。

resourceType: 资源类型。有父资源时，格式为{父资源类型code}/父资源ID/{资源类型code}

